                <span class="cfg-chip-val">24-Pack Carton</span>
                <span class="cfg-chip-code">+ /24PK</span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="cfg-field-notes" style="margin-top:6px; font-size:10px; color:var(--text-muted); letter-spacing:0.04em;">
              Pack matrix: 4&Prime; &rarr; Single/12-pack(MTO)/20-pack &middot; 6&Prime; &rarr; Single/12-pack(MTO)/24-pack &middot; 8&Prime; &rarr; Single/12-pack(QS)/20-pack. MTO = made-to-order, ~4-week lead time.
